  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"374\" id=\"isPasted\">About our brand and products:<br data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"178\">ARTBYHERCULES offers prints of contemporary oil paintings by Dutch painter Hercules (b. 1989). Making offs of her work can be found on her instagram @artbyhercules.</p><p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"374\">Each print is printed on premium paper and ships worldwide. Retail price: 45 EURO including free shipping. Affordable entry point for art lovers worldwide.</p><p data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"374\">All paintings and prints are part of the Feminine Fragments series by Hercules, a collection inspired by the lifestyle, aesthetics, and everyday details that women cherish. From fashion elements to interior touches, each work captures fragments of feminine style, turning them into timeless, collectible art pieces.</p><p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"718\">How to promote HERCULES:</p><ul data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1039\"><li data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"847\"><p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"847\">Share poster designs as stylish, affordable wall art</p></li><li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"918\"><p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"918\">Highlight the story of the artist and international collector base</p></li><li data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"965\"><p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"965\">Promote as unique home décor or gift ideas</p></li><li data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1039\"><p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1039\">Use blogs, interior design communities, newsletters, and social media</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1065\">Other information:</p><ul data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1202\"><li data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1094\"><p data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1094\">Global shipping included</p></li><li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1163\"><p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1163\">Website: <a data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1198\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\">www.artbyhercules.com</a><a data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1198\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\"></a></p></li></ul></div></div>",
